--libraryPath
SDL2_image

--methodClassName
SDL_imageNative

# IMG_SetError / IMG_GetError are macro shortcuts that point at SDL_SetError
# / SDL_GetError in the core class. ClangSharp can't cross the family
# methodClassName boundary, so emit them as part of the SDL2_image friendly
# wrapper layer later rather than as raw bindings.
--exclude
IMG_SetError
IMG_GetError
